OL,3,GNEWSAFarm plea as 30 sheep die in
OL,4,Asuspected dog attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty sheep have died following a
OL,7,Fsuspected dog attack on a family farm
OL,8,Fin West Yorkshire.
OL,10,FThe incident happened on Field Head
OL,11,FFarm in Holme Moss, south of
OL,12,FHuddersfield, between Tuesday night and
OL,13,FWednesday morning.
OL,15,FSome of the sheep are thought to have
OL,16,Fbeen mauled to death, while others died
OL,17,Ffrom stress after being chased,
OL,18,Faccording to James Brown, who works on
OL,19,Fthe farm.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
