OL,3,GNEWSAFarm plea as 30 sheep die in
OL,4,Asuspected dog attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe asked for any witnesses to come
OL,7,Fforward with information and appealed
OL,8,Fto dog walkers to keep their pets on a
OL,9,Flead.
